00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:50.740
Bourbon?

00:12:52.420 --> 00:12:53.510
Teio-san?

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:59.550
Your recovery seems to be 
going smoothly, Teio-san.

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:02.090
Yep. I can even run okay, now.

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:03.080
How about you?

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:06.090
Not for the time being.

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:07.400
I see...

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:11.120
You got hurt after the Kikkashou, right?

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:15.230
Yes, when I was training for the Japan Cup.

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:16.810
I see.

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:21.840
Rice Shower passes her! 
Rice Shower passes Bourbon!

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:24.530
There's barely a single length gap 
between them! Rice Shower has the lead!

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:25.990
And she clears the goal!

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:25.990
Kikkashou

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:25.990
Kikkashou

