00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:29.130
Mihono Bourbon's Triple Crown 
will remain incomplete!

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:32.290
The winning horse girl of the 
Kikkashou is Rice Shower!

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:35.250
By losing the Kikkashou,

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:38.750
I was unable to fulfill Master's 
request that I win a Triple Crown.

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:42.050
I may have been anxious to 
redeem myself as a result.

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:44.100
Expectations...

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:48.640
My goal is to win the Triple Crown
 undefeated, just like you!

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.510
So I have to win!

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:54.150
Right. I'll be looking forward to it.

00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:58.240
It was the same for me.

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:01.290
If I hadn't gotten injured, 
and had won the Triple Crown,

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:04.030
I might've gotten to see the Prez smile.

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:05.690
I can relate.

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:10.250
I was hoping to see my Master's smile, 
something I've never seen before.

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:15.160
Sorry about your Triple Crown, Bourbon.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:16.720
Likewise, Teio-san.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:21.860
But because I was unable 
to achieve a Triple Crown,

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:24.150
I was able to find a new reason for racing.

00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:26.880
Rice Shower.

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:27.940
Rice?

00:14:27.940 --> 00:14:31.250
Yes. The only horse girl to ever defeat me...

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:33.430
The person who kept me 
from reaching my dream.

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:37.560
She may be the first competitor 
I've felt I could call my rival.

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:42.250
Listen... about Rice...

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:43.480
Yes?

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:44.310
Beef steak!

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:45.010
Beef steak!

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:45.770
Beef steak!

00:14:45.770 --> 00:14:46.440
Beef steak!

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:47.250
Beef steak!

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:48.070
Beef steak!

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:48.820
Beef steak!

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:49.820
Beef steak!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:53.470
T-Teio-san?! What is it now?!

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:57.130
You don't have to be so scared! 
I'm not gonna do anything.

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:58.070
Rice...

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:00.540
B-Bourbon-san?!

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:04.790
You apparently don't intend 
to run in the Tennoushou?

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:10.790
You've gotta do something to convince 
her to run in the Tennoushou, Bourbon.

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:13.790
I bet she'll listen to you!

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:17.900
Leave this to me. There is a method 
I've learned from my Master.

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:18.920
Okay!

00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:21.050
Rice...

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:22.810
Y-Yes?

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:25.190
Quit your bellyaching and run!

00:15:25.700 --> 00:15:28.190
<i>I don't think she understood what I meant!</i>

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:30.700
Leave me alone, please!

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:33.920
That's strange! Master usually 
encourages me just like that!

00:15:33.920 --> 00:15:35.470
Never mind! Let's go after her!

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:36.450
Use this!

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:44.880
Rice, hold it!

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:55.970
She's so slippery!

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:57.850
Get back here!

00:15:58.110 --> 00:16:00.100
Hold it!

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:04.850
That nimble little...

00:16:04.850 --> 00:16:06.860
Hold it!

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:11.050
Slip!

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:15.370
<b><i>Later</i></b>

00:16:17.220 --> 00:16:18.120
The battery...

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.160
And that's what happened!

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:24.500
That is such a mood!

00:16:24.810 --> 00:16:26.390
What do you want to do for the midterm test?

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:27.000
Run!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:27.970
I know, right?

00:16:27.970 --> 00:16:29.140
Rice!

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:29.750
Rice!

00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:36.810
Hey, Palmer, did you see Rice Shower?

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:37.850
Rice?

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:39.540
Nope. Did you, Helios?

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:40.480
Sure didn't.

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:42.970
We're looking for her. 
Please let us know if you find her.

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:43.700
'Kay!

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:51.690
Rice, huh?

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:53.340
What's up? Something about her?

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:55.400
You remember at the Kikkashou?

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:57.710
Oh, she beat Bourbon! That was so hype!

00:16:57.710 --> 00:17:00.340
A hardcore race between 
two strong horse girls...

00:17:00.340 --> 00:17:03.580
I <i>so</i> want to do something like that!

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:05.820
How about with me? You wanna take me on?

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:06.970
You bet I do!

00:17:06.970 --> 00:17:08.770
NGL, we're just gonna run like usual!

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:10.090
I know, right?!

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:30.240
Not wanting to run... Do you suppose 
Rice-san has lost her confidence?

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:32.080
I'm sure that's not it!

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:34.940
Rice-chan's a really strong horse girl.

00:17:35.190 --> 00:17:37.710
When she locks in on her target,
 she gets so focused!

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:41.880
Although at the Kikkashou, I think
she was only looking at Bourbon-chan.

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:46.110
Right, you've raced her a few 
times yourself, haven't you?

00:17:46.110 --> 00:17:48.360
Yep! This is gonna be the seventh time.

00:17:49.390 --> 00:17:53.550
Y'know, she's kind of a big deal to me.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:55.420
I feel the same way.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:59.720
She demonstrated her strength 
without a doubt at the Nikkei Sho.

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:04.050
Tracen...

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:04.550
Fight!

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:04.990
On!

00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:05.340
Fight!

00:18:05.340 --> 00:18:05.680
On!

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:06.110
Fight!

00:18:06.110 --> 00:18:06.720
On!

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:15.410
Is it... okay if I run?

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:16.950
What're you doing?

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:18.740
What are <i>you</i> doing?

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:20.240
I'm gonna try and win the Triple Crown!

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.400
Not gonna happen! Because I'm gonna win it!

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:23.370
Hey, don't get in my way!

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:25.370
Yeah, that's right!

00:18:26.570 --> 00:18:28.830
Bourbon! You can win next time!

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:31.750
Winning the Triple Crown would've 
been cool, but you did a great job!

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:34.550
I'm still rooting for you!
 I love you, Bourbon!

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:36.540
You did a good job, Tannhäuser!

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:40.100
I can't do this anymore...

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:41.010
Rice!

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:44.320
We finally found her...

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:47.100
You don't know when to give up. 
Please, just leave me alone.

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:48.660
You're the one who didn't give up, Rice!

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:51.790
You never gave up during the Kikkashou!

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:53.900
Don't talk to me about the Kikkashou!

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:57.960
I just wanted people to accept me.

00:18:57.960 --> 00:19:02.630
I thought that if I could beat you, 
Bourbon-san, that they would.

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:05.410
That's why I tried so hard.

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:08.840
But nobody wanted me to win.

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:10.670
And when I did,

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:14.540
they just got mad, and didn't accept it!

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:19.090
I'm not like you two.

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:22.190
I'm a heel.

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:28.150
People hate me, boo me, 
and then I make them unhappy.

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:30.520
Even though my name's meant to be a blessing...

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:32.830
Even though I'm called Rice Shower.

00:19:33.840 --> 00:19:36.940
That's why I won't run anymore.

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:38.970
Rice...

00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:41.450
Quit your bellyaching and run!

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:43.390
How can you say that?!

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:45.350
Because I want you to run.

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:49.040
I don't understand! How can you say 
that after everything I told you?!

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:53.620
No one's happy if I run! Even when 
I win, it's just a disappointment!

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:55.670
There's no point in me running!

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:57.570
So, why—

00:19:57.570 --> 00:20:00.120
Because you are my hero.

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:10.810
I'm injured.

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:12.790
Seriously injured.

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:16.520
There have been times when I've 
been overwhelmed with anxiety

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:19.480
about whether I'd get to run again.

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:23.570
I was unable to meet my 
Master's expectations.

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:27.080
I even considered giving up on racing.

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:31.730
Bourbon... I pushed you too hard.

00:20:32.820 --> 00:20:33.800
I'm sorry.

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:46.410
But I never gave up because of you, Rice.

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:46.840
<b><i>Winning Horse Girl</i></b>

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:46.840
<b>Horse Girl of the Kikkashou
Up Close With Rice Shower</b>

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:52.350
<b>Up Close With the Winner of the Kikkashou, Rice Shower!
She Had Her Sights Set on Mihono Bourbon</b>

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:52.350
<b>"They Call Her the Assassin in Black!"

00:20:52.670 --> 00:20:55.850
Next time, I want to win. 
I don't want to lose again.

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:58.090
I want to race a strong opponent, like you.

00:20:58.090 --> 00:21:02.180
I've been able to work hard at 
my recovery because of that goal.

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:07.400
It's true that you took my dream.

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:11.250
But the hope and new dream you've 
given me are worth more than that.

00:21:11.760 --> 00:21:13.160
Bourbon-san...

00:21:14.010 --> 00:21:17.500
You're not a heel. You're a hero.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:21.030
I'm... a hero?

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:23.510
<i>Bourbon...</i>

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:27.010
And yet you came in eighth 
place at the Arima Kinen?!

00:21:26.150 --> 00:21:27.010
<b>Placed 11th at Arima</b>

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:30.630
You're my hero! You're a strong horse girl!

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:33.140
You have to run in the 
Tennoushou to prove that!

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:50.110
Stop being so selfish.

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:51.910
I'm sorry.

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:54.760
You can say all that, but it's 
just more trouble for me.

00:21:57.150 --> 00:21:58.090
But...

00:21:58.720 --> 00:22:01.830
I understand how you feel, Bourbon-san.

00:22:02.810 --> 00:22:05.670
I'm going to try again.

00:22:09.070 --> 00:22:11.430
I'm still scared, but...

00:22:13.300 --> 00:22:14.090
Right.

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:18.830
I want to run with you too,
 Bourbon-san. So...

00:22:22.560 --> 00:22:25.540
I'm going to enter the Tennoushou!
